As a Production Operator, you will work with different machines and make sure the glass is processed correctly. Operating and setting up production machines; 
Carrying out quality checks; 
Checking that the production process is running correctly; 
Taking on more responsibility within the production process. 
You will work an average of 38 hours per week in a 3-shift schedule. The shifts rotate between early, late and night shifts: 05:30-14:00, 14:00-22:30 and 22:30-05:30. On Fridays, the late shift ends at 23:00. The night shift starts earlier on Sunday evening because the machines need to be started. 15.92 gross per hour plus a 23% shift allowance, giving you €19.58 gross per hour; 
